---
source: crates/ambers-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "ok_stdout(&[\"--help\"])"
---
Inspect SPSS .sav and .zsav files

Usage: ambers <COMMAND>

Commands:
  info  Print a file's summary and its variables
  view  Browse a file's data in a full-screen grid
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
